Use the Guix-managed DeepSeek engine for setup and configuration refresh.

DeepSeek has a separate executable from Qwen.  Both engines share the
package's compiled HIP architectures and runtime libraries; model setup must
use those inputs rather than downloading another engine or selecting a stale
user installation.  Configuration refresh preserves each model's engine.

